# Frontend build output embedded into the sparkles binary via go:embed
# (v100/dev/webui). Real build output (from v100/build-server.sh) is never
# committed; only a placeholder index.html is tracked so `go build` succeeds
# on a fresh checkout without Node/npm installed.
!v100/dev/webui/dist/
v100/dev/webui/dist/*
!v100/dev/webui/dist/index.html